    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does Google Ads for dental clinics in Bangalore cost?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We work in three tiers for most dental clinics: Starter from Rs 1 Lakh / month retainer, Growth from Rs 1.5-3 Lakh / month, and Enterprise above Rs 3 Lakh / month. Ad spend is pass-through, billed by you directly on platforms. Full tier pricing is published on our pricing page."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How long before we see results from Google Ads in Bangalore?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"For dental clinics, meaningful signal usually arrives in weeks 3-6: lower CPL, higher ROAS, better conversion. Compounding - subscription attach, repeat rate, organic lift - shows at month 3-6. We publish a 90-day plan on day one so expectations are clear."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is a realistic ROAS target for a dental clinic in Bangalore?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"For dental clinics in Bangalore, we target blended ROAS in the range typical for the category and AOV (Rs 500 (consult) to Rs 1-5L (implants, aligners, cosmetic)): what matters more is LTV / CAC, repeat rate and payback period. We rebuild attribution first so we are optimising against real economics, not platform-reported numbers."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you only run Google Ads (Search + PMax + Shopping), or do you handle the full funnel for dental clinics?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We handle the full funnel. For dental clinics that includes creative, Shopify / website, WhatsApp CRM, SEO, retention flows and reporting. Google Ads is the acquisition layer; without the funnel underneath, scaled spend wastes money."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you work with a dental clinic that is just launching in Bangalore?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Pre-launch is a strong moment for dental clinic