type":"Question","name":"Do you provide dedicated account management for dental clinics in Bangalore?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Every account has a dedicated performance lead, creative producer and strategist. On Growth and Enterprise tiers, you get a full pod (strategy + performance + creative + CRM + reporting). Weekly syncs and monthly QBRs are standard."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you share named references of other dental clinics you have worked with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, under NDA on a discovery call. Most of our dental clinics clients prefer confidentiality while they scale. We can connect you directly with past clients to ask about delivery, attribution honesty and team quality."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What makes Google Ads for dental clinics different from a traditional agency?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We are a tech + marketing studio. We rebuild attribution, write production code, run performance ads, build the WhatsApp CRM and ship the mobile app - often inside the same engagement. Agencies hand you a deck; we hand you a working system."}}]}</script>
