                    <span class="pm-eyebrow">Why Dental Clinics in Bangalore is different</span>
                    <h2>What makes Google Ads for dental clinic buyers in Bangalore unlike generic campaigns</h2>
                    <p>Patients booking dentists want: trust, convenience, cost clarity, pain management, specialty match (orthodontist vs implantologist vs cosmetic). Bangalore is a tech-salary consumer market with the highest per-capita D2C penetration in India. Early adopters, strong subscription attach rates, and global brand awareness. For Google Ads, this means your campaigns have to do more than drive clicks - they have to earn trust, qualify intent, and deliver the enquiry or sale into the right follow-up motion. For dental clinics in Bangalore specifically, the local nuance matters: English + Kannada + Hindi + Tamil + Telugu creative all have a place. Indiranagar, Koramangala, Whitefield, HSR Layout have distinct demographics.</p>
                    <p><strong>Buyer mindset:</strong> Patients booking dentists want: trust, convenience, cost clarity, pain management, specialty match (orthodontist vs implantologist vs cosmetic).</p>
                    <p><strong>Typical AOV:</strong> Rs 500 (consult) to Rs 1-5L (implants, aligners, cosmetic) &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; <strong>Sales cycle:</strong> 1-21 days for routine; 30-90 days for cosmetic + aligner + implant decisions</p>
                    <div class="pm-compliance"><strong>Compliance note:</strong> Follow NMC + Dental Council of India advertising guidelines. No outcome promises. No price undercutting messaging. No testimonial-driven paid ads from identifiable patients.</div>
