            <h2>How we run Google Ads for dental clinics in Bangalore</h2>
            <p>Our Google Ads approach for dental clinics starts with attribution. Before we touch spend, we rebuild tracking so platform-reported ROAS stops lying - CRM + Meta CAPI + Google Enhanced Conversions + offline conversion imports where relevant. Then we build the channel architecture: Google Search (dentist + treatment + city queries), Google Business Profile, Google Call Ads, WhatsApp enquiry automation as primary, with Meta Ads (education + brand), Local community apps, Practo / Lybrate listings layered in as the account matures. Creative strategy is the next lever. For dental clinics the angles that consistently work are: Treatment explainers (RCT, aligners, implants, veneers), Clinic + doctor credentials, Pain-free + anxiety-free positioning, Transparent cost ranges. We ship 20-30 creative units a month in the first 6 months because creative velocity is the single biggest CPL lever early in an engagement.</p>

            <h3>Channels we prioritise</h3>
            <div class="pm-channel-grid">
                <div class="pm-channel-item"><span class="pm-channel-num">01</span><div><strong>Google Search (dentist + treatment + city queries)</strong><p>High-intent patient searches for treatments and clinic location.</p></div></div><div class="pm-channel-item"><span class="pm-channel-num">02</span><div><strong>Google Business Profile</strong><p>Local pack rankings + calls + directions + photo-driven trust.</p></div></div><div class="pm-channel-item"><span class="pm-channel-num">03</span><div><strong>Google Call Ads</strong><p>Direct call-only campaigns from Google Search, measured as booked appointments.</p></div></div><div class="pm-channel-item"><span class="pm-channel-num">04</span><div><strong>WhatsApp enquiry automation</strong><p>60-second response + routing to the right executive + CRM capture.</p></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="pm-chips-secondary">
                <span style="font-size:12px; font-weight:800; color:#64748b; letter-spacing:0.5px; text-transform:uppercase; margin-right:8px;">Secondary channels:</span>
                <span class="pm-chip-secondary">Meta Ads (education + brand)</span><span class="pm-chip-secondary">Local community apps</span><span class="pm-chip-secondary">Practo / Lybrate listings</span>
            </div>

            <h3>KPIs we track from day one</h3>
            <div class="pm-kpi-pills">
